41
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,630
You just wait!

42
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:46,800
My power is far greater than yours!

43
00:02:51,610 --> 00:02:54,400
<i>Cell has begun moving out in earnest,</i>

44
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,440
<i>heading toward his perfect form!</i>

45
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:02,620
<i>What has been feared is now coming true.</i>

46
00:03:06,270 --> 00:03:14,250
{\an8}How I Have Waited for This Day!!

47
00:03:06,270 --> 00:03:14,250
{\an8}Cell • Prologue to Perfection

48
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:43,450
For not even being an android, you have fantastic power.

49
00:03:44,510 --> 00:03:47,950
It is certainly apparent that you are not Piccolo Daimao.

50
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:55,710
Of course, I have no interest in your identity.

51
00:03:56,550 --> 00:03:58,970
I only want to know where Son Goku is.

52
00:03:59,890 --> 00:04:03,060
As usual, I don't suppose you are of the mind to tell us, are you?

53
00:04:03,690 --> 00:04:07,080
Your objective is to kill Goku.

54
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:12,600
There's no reason that I should tell you where he is.

55
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:16,150
Well then, shall we continue the fight?

56
00:04:17,790 --> 00:04:19,450
I think you'll come to want to speak.

57
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:26,040
This time, I'm fighting like I mean it!

58
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,690
Your speed is decent.

59
00:06:11,690 --> 00:06:14,480
But your punches don't seem to have enough weight behind them.

60
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,580
<i>What was that?!</i>

61
00:06:17,490 --> 00:06:20,160
How nice of you to talk so big.

62
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:26,780
As you face the strongest man in history, Android No.17...

63
00:07:17,050 --> 00:07:20,150
That guy really is strong.

64
00:07:20,150 --> 00:07:22,210
He's evenly matched against No.17.

65
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:37,520
Piccolo-san, hang in there!

66
00:07:38,670 --> 00:07:40,690
Keep it up, Piccolo!

67
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:45,030
Until Vegeta and Trunks' training is finished...

68
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:49,380
Yeesh. How many islands are you going to destroy before you're satisfied?

69
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,300
A-Awesome.

70
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:12,300
Piccolo still seems to be hanging in there.

71
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:20,020
Dammit, are we just going to stay here like this?

72
00:10:32,780 --> 00:10:34,780
How can this be?!

73
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:37,990
Wh-What's wrong?

74
00:10:38,820 --> 00:10:43,000
H-He's coming closer! At a time like this...!

75
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:45,710
C-Cell?

76
00:10:48,930 --> 00:10:50,460
I-It can't be!

77
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:26,340
I've waited a long time for this day to come!

78
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:29,750
The day when I become my perfect form!

79
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:09,860
Ah, there, there! There, there! Googley googley goo!

80
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:13,230
Don't cry, now. Don't cry.

81
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:16,220
Bulma, I can't manage him!

82
00:12:17,370 --> 00:12:18,990
This is the last frequency.

83
00:12:19,890 --> 00:12:23,000
Once I finish punching in this data, it will be complete!

84
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:30,060
Say, Dad, keep Trunks quiet a bit longer!

85
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:36,320
Yeah, well, you see...

86
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,360
You're his mother, ain'tcha?

87
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:43,990
Come look after yer baby some! It's more'n I can stand!

88
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:48,720
'nbelievable! Bein' raised by such a cold mother like this,

89
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:51,420
in time this kid's gonna go bad!

90
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:56,980
Horsefeathers! There's no need to worry about that!

91
00:12:58,260 --> 00:13:02,850
Trunks is going to become an incredibly cool and handsome young man, after all.

92
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,010
Aren't you, Trunks?

93
00:13:05,690 --> 00:13:08,850
Is it okay now? Are you finished?

94
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:18,150
With this, we'll be able to utterly terminate the Androids' actions!

95
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:36,160
My, my!

96
00:15:52,270 --> 00:15:54,140
What do we do, Kuririn?

97
00:15:54,690 --> 00:15:57,590
H-How can I answer something like that?

98
00:15:58,270 --> 00:16:03,860
If this Cell monster were to absorb the Androids now,

99
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:07,530
