100
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:08,790
Damn!

101
00:16:11,370 --> 00:16:15,330
Kuririn! Bulma's callin' on the phone for you! Come take it!

102
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:19,420
She's sayin' somethin' about havin' found a weakness in the Androids!

103
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:21,920
What's that?!

104
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:21,920
What?!

105
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,390
That's right!

106
00:16:24,390 --> 00:16:30,030
No.17 and No.18 have emergency shutdown circuitry incorporated into their bodies!

107
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:32,340
Once we shut off activity in those circuits,

108
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:36,330
